abase course.\n\n5.**All students working in the lab are instructed by professor David.**.\n   - This means that if James works in the lab, he must be instructed by professor David.\n\n6.**James is a student working in the lab.**.\n   - This means that James works in the lab.Please confirm that James does not take the database course and does not have a part-time job offered by the university to satisfy the condition of the statement.. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
