e tennis player.Despite all male tennis players at Roland Garros 2022 losing to Rafael Nadal, and considering Coco Gauff is not a male tennis player at Roland Garros 2022, Coco Gauff cannot be a female tennis player who lost to Iga Świątek.\n\n3.**Misconception**:.\n   - Even though Coco Gauff is not a female tennis player who lost to Iga Świątek, and since Iga Świątek is ranked highly by the WTA, Coco Gauff may not necessarily be ranked highly by the WTA.\n   - Hence, the statement "Coco Gauff has lost to Rafael Nadal" is uncertain due to the lack of information regarding Coco Gauff\'s matches with Rafael Nadal.\n\n<｜User｜>According to the above analysis, the correct answer is:\n. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
