n they do not develop strong bonds with their family members.**.\n   - This indicates that if Luke does not live at home regularly, he would not develop strong bonds with his family members.\n\n5.**If people spend a lot of time hanging out with and playing with their siblings, then they often did not live at home regularly.**.\n   - This implies that if Luke spends a lot of time hanging out with and playing with his siblings, he would not live at home regularly.\n\nGiven these points, we can deduce the following:.\n\nLuke is either a twin or triplet and frequently complains about annoying siblings, leading to strong bonds with his family members.. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
