fice are people who own a large desktop monitor at their home.This means that having a fully stocked and impressive home office is a sufficient condition for owning a large desktop monitor.\n\n3.**Office Supply Store Visits**: The context also mentions that all people who work regularly and often at home visit the office supply store regularly.This indicates that visiting the office supply store is a necessary condition for working regularly and often at home.\n\nNow, let\'s analyze the statement "Remy has a fully stocked and impressive home office and also visits the office supply store regularly":.Remy does not have a fully stocked and impressive home office, and also does not visit the office supply store regularly.. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
